WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.400
Open the compact Kubernetes log
Real CRI records with a nested JSON payload.

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.000
Press w — make JSON readable
Expand the nested payload directly inside the log view.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Move through the expanded events
Keep the original timestamp and structured fields in view.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Press 6 — inspect the detected fields
Structured field selection is available without rewriting the log.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.300
Type service:payment
Add an include filter; keep only payment events.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.100
Type level:error
Stack a second include filter on top of service:payment.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.900
Type x — remove last filter
Undo level:error; keep the broader service:payment filter.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.300
Press w — switch back to compact
The filters stay active while the JSON view changes.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.800
Press w — expand the payload again
From compact records to readable JSON in one keystroke.
